SUMMARY:Best Practices in Survey Design
DESCRIPTION:While surveys are one of the most commonly used data collection methods\, designing effective surveys that provide actionable and meaningful data can be challenging. In this workshop\, we will discuss how to decide if a survey is the best method as your evaluation tool\, and provide tips on good survey design and question writing. \nPlease register to secure your spot.\nRegister
URL:https://events.ubc.ca/event/best-practices-in-survey-design-4/
