SUMMARY:The Beauty of it All and X̱wi7x̱wa Library Tour
DESCRIPTION:Starting at the Beaty Biodiversity Museum\, artist Daphne Boyer will lead a 45-minute tour of the exhibition Li bootee mishiwayitay — The Beauty of It All from 2:00 to 2:45 pm. \nAfter that\, the group will walk to X̱wi7x̱wa Library at 3:00 pm\, for a tour with Head Librarian\, Kayla Lar-Son. \nFollowing the tour\, participants will learn about the Rebuilding Relations Project with Assistant Professor and Canada Research Chair in Indigenous Peoples\, Governance & Environmental Relations\, Warren Cardinal-McTeague. \nIncluded with regular museum admission\, payable on entry. Pre-registration required\, limited space available.
