SUMMARY:Long Table Dinner at the UBC Farm
DESCRIPTION:UBC Farm’s Long Table Dinner  \n✨It’s the last chance to reserve your seat for UBC Farm’s Long Table Dinner on Thursday\, August 13 from 5:00-9:00 pm — an evening of local flavours\, community\, and celebration in the Poplar Grove. 🌿  \nEnjoy a farm-to-table feast created by UBC Executive Chef David Speight\, featuring the season’s best from UBC Farm and served by the wonderful Sage Catering team.  \n✨  \nThursday\, August 13\, 2026  \n🚜 Farm Tour departs at 5:15 pm (optional)  \n🥗 Dinner: 6:30 – 9:00 pm  \n🎟️ $275  \nProceeds from this event will contribute toward the development of our new Farm Centre\, an important investment that will strengthen our capacity for teaching\, research\, community engagement\, and sustainable food systems innovation for years to come. 
URL:https://events.ubc.ca/event/long-table-dinner-at-the-ubc-farm/
